// The common blue 16x2 character LCD (1602A) with an FC-113 style PCF8574 I2C backpack.
// Bench frame: z = 0 is the underside of the backpack components so the module lies flat with
// the glass facing +Z. The FC-113 backpack PCB sits at z = 5.0 mm (top at z = 6.6 mm) under the
// 1602A panel (at z = 10.5 mm), with its 4-pin right-angle header (GND, VCC, SDA, SCL on 2.54 mm)
// pointing sideways along -X parallel to the PCB for female jumper wires.
